WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.150 --> 00:00:02.381
- I heard the girl that
played the 13-year-old you,

00:00:02.381 --> 00:00:04.880
Christa Allen, is turning 30 this year,

00:00:04.880 --> 00:00:07.550
if that doesn't make us all feel old.

00:00:07.550 --> 00:00:09.670
She did a few TikTok tributes.

00:00:09.670 --> 00:00:11.095
Here is one, I gotta show you.

00:00:11.095 --> 00:00:13.260
- You know what?

00:00:13.260 --> 00:00:16.400
You are rude and mean
and sloppy and frizzy.

00:00:16.400 --> 00:00:17.677
I don't like you at all.

00:00:17.677 --> 00:00:18.722
(crowd laughs)

00:00:18.722 --> 00:00:22.390
- (laughs) Love that she did that.

00:00:22.390 --> 00:00:23.897
Have you seen them?

00:00:23.897 --> 00:00:25.230
- She is uncanny.

00:00:25.230 --> 00:00:26.190
Yes, I've seen her.

00:00:26.190 --> 00:00:28.920
She played the young
me in "13 Going On 30,"

00:00:28.920 --> 00:00:31.240
and then again in "Ghost
of Girlfriends Past"

00:00:31.240 --> 00:00:33.737
because I needed a
young me again and said,

00:00:33.737 --> 00:00:35.821
"I know the perfect young lady."

00:00:35.821 --> 00:00:36.690
- [Kelly] Yeah.

00:00:36.690 --> 00:00:39.870
- And so, you know, I've
always been aware of her

00:00:39.870 --> 00:00:42.989
since then, and we've kind of
texted or DMed back and forth,

00:00:42.989 --> 00:00:46.690
and whenever I see her, she's
just like a prettier version

00:00:46.690 --> 00:00:47.907
of me at 30.

00:00:47.907 --> 00:00:49.228
Look at her, it's crazy.

00:00:49.228 --> 00:00:50.230
(Kelly laughs)

00:00:50.230 --> 00:00:52.980
- How did she have that dress?
I don't have that dress.

